flowchart TB
  App[Root app / extracted API / worker] --> Telemetry[Sanitized telemetry target]
  Telemetry --> AppInsights[Application Insights definition]
  AppInsights --> LogAnalytics[Log Analytics definition]
  Events[Security ingestion] --> Failures[Failure records]
  Events --> Checkpoint[Checkpoints]
  Recovery[Authorized recovery job] --> Lease[Exclusive lease]
  Lease --> Replay[Bounded idempotent replay]
  Replay --> Checkpoint
  Data[(Database target)] --> Backup[Backup/restore readiness evidence]
  boundary[External monitoring and backup state require separate verification] --- Backup
